INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (3,1,'2026-09-21 16:58:55','2026-09-21 16:58:55','<p>This demonstration site stores only the standard WordPress account and content data created during local setup. It does not run advertising trackers. If you deploy the project, replace this page with a policy that matches your host and analytics tools.</p>','Privacy Policy','','publish','closed','open','','privacy-policy','','','2026-09-21 22:30:30','2026-09-21 17:00:30','',0,'http://127.0.0.1:8080/?page_id=3',0,'page','',0),(4,0,'2026-09-21 16:59:13','2026-09-21 16:59:13','','Default Kit','','publish','closed','closed','','default-kit','','','2026-09-21 16:59:55','2026-09-21 16:59:55','',0,'http://127.0.0.1:8080/?p=4',0,'elementor_library','',0),(5,2,'2026-09-03 03:24:06','2026-09-03 03:24:06','<p>The first public screening of the ensemble drama “Harbour Lights” turned into an unofficial festival of umbrellas, fan chants, and a closing-credits needle-drop nobody had leaked.</p><p>This is original sample reporting written for a WordPress internship assignment. Names, titles, and events are fictional placeholders so the site can be demonstrated without copying copyrighted entertainment coverage.</p><p>Cast members walked a shortened carpet and spent more time in the photo pit than on staged interviews.</p><p>Studio publicists confirmed a nationwide expansion two weeks after the limited opening.</p><p>Fashion desks noted a run of monochrome tailoring rather than the usual metallic crush.</p><p>Editors will replace these stories with real reporting before any public launch. Until then, every card, permalink, and category archive is wired to an actual WordPress post so the homepage behaves like a live newsroom.</p>','Midnight Premiere Lights Up the Season’s Most Talked-About Ensemble Drama','A rain-soaked red carpet, a surprise musical cue, and a cast that actually lingered with fans.','publish','open','open','','midnight-premiere-ensemble-drama','','','2026-09-03 03:24:06','2026-09-03 03:24:06','',0,'http://127.0.0.1:8080/midnight-premiere-ensemble-drama/',0,'post','',0),(6,0,'2026-09-21 16:59:19','2026-09-21 16:59:19','','Midnight Premiere Lights Up the Season’s Most Talked-About Ensemble Drama','','inherit','open','closed','','midnight-premiere-lights-up-the-seasons-most-talked-about-ensemble-drama','','','2026-09-21 16:59:19','2026-09-21 16:59:19','',5,'http://127.0.0.1:8080/midnight-premiere-ensemble-drama/midnight-premiere-lights-up-the-seasons-most-talked-about-ensemble-drama/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(7,3,'2026-09-12 20:08:20','2026-09-12 20:08:20','<p>From airport lounge-to-runway dressing to a charity gala in the city, this week’s best looks were less about logos and more about silhouette.</p><p>This is original sample reporting written for a WordPress internship assignment. Names, titles, and events are fictional placeholders so the site can be demonstrated without copying copyrighted entertainment coverage.</p><p>A structured ivory coat with a cropped hem became the most screenshotted departure look.</p><p>Stylists we spoke to pointed to a return of hand embroidery on evening suiting.</p><p>Street-style photographers camped outside two private dinners and still went home happy.</p><p>Editors will replace these stories with real reporting before any public launch. Until then, every card, permalink, and category archive is wired to an actual WordPress post so the homepage behaves like a live newsroom.</p>','Top Celebrity Looks That Stole the Spotlight This Week','Sculptural coats, vintage embroidery, and one unforgettable silver sari moment.','publish','open','open','','top-celebrity-looks-this-week','','','2026-09-12 20:08:20','2026-09-12 20:08:20','',0,'http://127.0.0.1:8080/top-celebrity-looks-this-week/',0,'post','',0),(8,0,'2026-09-21 16:59:20','2026-09-21 16:59:20','','Top Celebrity Looks That Stole the Spotlight This Week','','inherit','open','closed','','top-celebrity-looks-that-stole-the-spotlight-this-week','','','2026-09-21 16:59:20','2026-09-21 16:59:20','',7,'http://127.0.0.1:8080/top-celebrity-looks-this-week/top-celebrity-looks-that-stole-the-spotlight-this-week/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(9,3,'2026-09-19 13:40:28','2026-09-19 13:40:28','<p>Vintage coordinators are the new power brokers. Three publicists independently told StarVista they now budget for archive loans the way they once budgeted for jewelry.</p><p>This is original sample reporting written for a WordPress internship assignment. Names, titles, and events are fictional placeholders so the site can be demonstrated without copying copyrighted entertainment coverage.</p><p>The most requested silhouette is a bias-cut column with a modest neckline.</p><p>Insurance paperwork, not availability, is the real bottleneck.</p><p>Editors will replace these stories with real reporting before any public launch. Until then, every card, permalink, and category archive is wired to an actual WordPress post so the homepage behaves like a live newsroom.</p>','The Archive Gown Making a Quiet Comeback on Every Carpet','Why 1990s atelier pieces are outperforming brand-new couture in the photo pit.','publish','open','open','','archive-gown-comeback','','','2026-09-19 13:40:28','2026-09-19 13:40:28','',0,'http://127.0.0.1:8080/archive-gown-comeback/',0,'post','',0),(10,0,'2026-09-21 16:59:21','2026-09-21 16:59:21','','The Archive Gown Making a Quiet Comeback on Every Carpet','','inherit','open','closed','','the-archive-gown-making-a-quiet-comeback-on-every-carpet','','','2026-09-21 16:59:21','2026-09-21 16:59:21','',9,'http://127.0.0.1:8080/archive-gown-comeback/the-archive-gown-making-a-quiet-comeback-on-every-carpet/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(11,3,'2026-09-07 12:01:30','2026-09-07 12:01:30','<p>Early-morning departures used to be a styling afterthought. Not anymore — cameras at terminals are as relentless as premiere pits.</p><p>This is original sample reporting written for a WordPress internship assignment. Names, titles, and events are fictional placeholders so the site can be demonstrated without copying copyrighted entertainment coverage.</p><p>Neutral palettes still win, but a single saturated accessory is back.</p><p>Oversized sunglasses remain undefeated.</p><p>Editors will replace these stories with real reporting before any public launch. Until then, every card, permalink, and category archive is wired to an actual WordPress post so the homepage behaves like a live newsroom.</p>','Airport Style, Elevated: Travel Looks That Still Photograph Well at 6 a.m.','Knit sets, longline blazers, and sneakers that do not look like a sponsorship.','publish','open','open','','airport-style-elevated','','','2026-09-07 12:01:30','2026-09-07 12:01:30','',0,'http://127.0.0.1:8080/airport-style-elevated/',0,'post','',0),(12,0,'2026-09-21 16:59:22','2026-09-21 16:59:22','','Airport Style, Elevated: Travel Looks That Still Photograph Well at 6 a.m.','','inherit','open','closed','','airport-style-elevated-travel-looks-that-still-photograph-well-at-6-a-m','','','2026-09-21 16:59:22','2026-09-21 16:59:22','',11,'http://127.0.0.1:8080/airport-style-elevated/airport-style-elevated-travel-looks-that-still-photograph-well-at-6-a-m/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(13,4,'2026-09-08 05:56:01','2026-09-08 05:56:01','<p>Menswear on the carpet is finally catching up with the risk-taking that womenswear has treated as default.</p><p>This is original sample reporting written for a WordPress internship assignment. Names, titles, and events are fictional placeholders so the site can be demonstrated without copying copyrighted entertainment coverage.</p><p>Jewel-tone dinner jackets outperformed classic black in last month’s openings.</p><p>Stylists cited a handful of independent Indian ateliers as the season’s quiet winners.</p><p>Editors will replace these stories with real reporting before any public launch. Until then, every card, permalink, and category archive is wired to an actual WordPress post so the homepage 